---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout 
  title="Disclaimer - MyPincodes.in"
  description="Official disclaimer regarding government affiliation and postal tariff calculations on MyPincodes.in."
  activePage="home"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-accent-600 tracking-wider">Notice</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">
          Disclaimer
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-2">
          Last updated: October 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 font-medium">
          <strong>Important Notice:</strong> MyPincodes.in is an independent informational and logistics utility portal. We are <strong>NOT affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the Department of Posts (India Post), the Ministry of Communications, or the Government of India.</strong>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">Official Sources</h2>
        <p>
          The official website of the Department of Posts, Government of India can be found at <a href="https://www.indiapost.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 underline">https://www.indiapost.gov.in</a>. All postal trademarks, "Speed Post" branding, and postal emblems belong to their respective statutory owners.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">Calculators & Rate Estimates</h2>
        <p>
          The Speed Post tariffs and delivery timeframes generated by our calculators are estimates based on published official Department of Posts domestic tariff notifications. Actual counter tariffs may vary based on exact weight scales, dimensional weight (volumetric), fuel surcharges, pickup location, or booking category (retail vs corporate bulk booking). Users are encouraged to verify critical rates directly at their local post office booking counter.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">Geographic Coordinates & Distances</h2>
        <p>
          Straight-line and road transit distance estimates are calculated using mathematical models (Haversine formula and average highway transit factors). They do not represent exact GPS turn-by-turn routing.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
